<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Banc One upgraded to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Banc One upgraded to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said analyst Carole Berger upgraded Banc One Corp to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- She said she views Banc One's agreement to buy First USA Inc as &quot;a significant strategic move for Banc One, positioning them as a national consumer finance company.&quot;</p>
<p>-- She sees Banc One stock selling at $50 at year-end.</p>
<p>-- The shares were up 1-1/8 to 42-5/8.</p>
</text>
